OL,3,GNEWSAStink row landfill firm to fight
OL,4,Awinding-up bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe operator of a landfill site, blamed
OL,7,Fby some villagers for creating a
OL,8,F"horrendous" smell, plans to fight a
OL,9,Fclosure order brought against it by the
OL,10,Ftax authorities.
OL,12,FHMRC refused to say how much it
OL,13,Fbelieves Seletia (HW) Limited, which
OL,14,Fruns Hespin Wood Landfill alongside the
OL,15,FM6 motorway north of Carlisle, owes the
OL,16,Fgovernment, but its application for a
OL,17,Fwinding-up petition will be heard on 9
OL,18,FDecember.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
