OL,3,GNEWSAStink row landfill firm to fight
OL,4,Awinding-up bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA winding-up petition, if successful,
OL,7,Fleads to a company being liquidated,
OL,8,Fits assets sold and money being paid to
OL,9,Fcreditors.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for Seletia said it was
OL,12,F"confident in its legal and financial
OL,13,Fposition" and the application would
OL,14,Fhave "no impact" on day-to-day
OL,15,Foperations at Hespin Wood.
